      "name": "Dagger Defense",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "1 to 3\n\n---\nThe archer regiment draws daggers to attack close-range enemies. Each enemy in a 5-foot emanation must attempt a DC 29 basic Reflex save save. The damage depends on the number of actions. The archer regiment gains a +1 circumstance bonus to AC until the beginning of their next turn.\n\n1 2d4+2 piercing damage\n\n2 4d4+12 piercing damage\n\n3 4d4+15 piercing damage"
    },
