    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Rain of Arrows",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The archer regiment fires their longbows in a coordinated volley. This volley is either a 15-foot burst within 200 feet that deals 4d8 piercing damage or a 10-foot burst within 100 feet that deals 6d8 piercing damage. Either effect has a DC 29 basic Reflex save save. When the archer regiment is reduced to 2 segments, both areas are reduced by 5 feet."
    }
